It is a clean repackaging of work first written in the author's repository
"resolvent" (https://github.com/teerthsharma/resolvent, Apache-2.0,
Copyright 2026 Teerth Sharma), from the files sun/rjepa/chase/rjepa_ops.py,
sun/rjepa/foreman/rjepa.py and sun/rjepa/cameron/rj.py and their tests.

rjepa/djepa.py and the "djepa" head in rjepa/heads.py reimplement the relational
candidate operator described in

  Shuaijun Liu, Chengyu Wu, Qifu Wen, Feiyang You, Chenglong Zhang, Shuyang Hao,
  Xi Lin, Ningxin Su. "D-JEPA: A Decision-Aligned Latent World Model."
  arXiv:2609.24749v1, 2026 (CC BY 4.0).

The reimplementation was written from the paper's equations and hyperparameters
only. No code was copied from, and the repository was not cloned or downloaded:
https://github.com/NEBULIS-Lab/D-JEPA (Apache-2.0). Any difference between this
operator and the authors' released code is a property of this reimplementation,
not of D-JEPA.
